or third-party applications sold through the App Store, the Company does not obtain control of the product before transferring it to the customer.\nTherefore, the Company accounts for all third-party application–related sales on a net basis by recognizing in Services net sales only the commission it retains.\n\nNet sales disaggregated by significant products and services for 2024, 2023 and 2022 were as follows (in millions):\n                                                                                                                       2024               2023               2022",
